{"v":1,"book":"Zech","ch":7,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"And in the fourth year of Darius the king the word of Jehovah came to Zechariah on the fourth day of the ninth month, the month Chislev.","tok":[{"t":"And in the "},{"t":"fourth","s":["H0702"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"year","s":["H8141"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Darius","s":["H1867"],"a":[3]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"king","s":["H4428"],"a":[4]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"word","s":["H1697"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[7]},{"t":" came to "},{"t":"Zechariah","s":["H2148"],"a":[9]},{"t":" on the "},{"t":"fourth","s":["H0702"],"a":[10]},{"t":" day of the "},{"t":"ninth","s":["H8671"],"a":[12]},{"t":" "},{"t":"month","s":["H2320"],"a":[11]},{"t":", the month Chislev."}]},{"n":2,"text":"Now the people of Bethel had sent Sharezer and Regemmelech and their men to entreat the favor of Jehovah","tok":[{"t":"Now the people of Bethel had "},{"t":"sent","s":["H7971"],"a":[0]},{"t":" Sharezer and Regemmelech and their "},{"t":"men","s":["H0582"],"a":[7]},{"t":" to entreat the favor of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[11]}]},{"n":3,"text":"By speaking to the priests who belong to the house of Jehovah of hosts and to the prophets, saying, Shall I weep in the fifth month and separate myself, as I have done these many years?","tok":[{"t":"By "},{"t":"speaking","s":["H0559"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"priests","s":["H3548"],"a":[2]},{"t":" who belong to the "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[6]},{"t":" and to the "},{"t":"prophets","s":["H5030"],"a":[8]},{"t":", "},{"t":"saying","s":["H0559"],"a":[9]},{"t":", Shall I "},{"t":"weep","s":["H1058"],"a":[10]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"fifth","s":["H2549"],"a":[12]},{"t":" "},{"t":"month","s":["H2320"],"a":[11]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"separate","s":["H5144"],"a":[13]},{"t":" myself, as I have "},{"t":"done","s":["H6213"],"a":[15]},{"t":" these many "},{"t":"years","s":["H8141"],"a":[18]},{"t":"?"}]},{"n":4,"text":"Then the word of Jehovah of hosts came to me, saying,","tok":[{"t":"Then the "},{"t":"word","s":["H1697"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[3]},{"t":" came to me, "},{"t":"saying","s":["H0559"],"a":[5]},{"t":","}]},{"n":5,"text":"Speak to all the people of the land and to the priests, saying, When you fasted and mourned in the fifth and seventh months, even for these seventy years, was it at all for Me that you fasted?","tok":[{"t":"Speak","s":["H0559"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to all the "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[4]},{"t":" and to the "},{"t":"priests","s":["H3548"],"a":[6]},{"t":", "},{"t":"saying","s":["H0559"],"a":[7]},{"t":", When you "},{"t":"fasted","s":["H6684"],"a":[9]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"mourned","s":["H5594"],"a":[10]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"fifth","s":["H2549"],"a":[11]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"seventh","s":["H7637"],"a":[12]},{"t":" months, even for these "},{"t":"seventy","s":["H7657"],"a":[14]},{"t":" "},{"t":"years","s":["H8141"],"a":[15]},{"t":", was it at "},{"t":"all","s":["H6684"],"a":[16]},{"t":" for Me that you "},{"t":"fasted","s":["H6684"],"a":[17]},{"t":"?"}]},{"n":6,"text":"And when you eat and when you drink, are you not the ones eating and are you not the ones drinking?","tok":[{"t":"And when you "},{"t":"eat","s":["H0398"],"a":[1]},{"t":" and when you "},{"t":"drink","s":["H8354"],"a":[3]},{"t":", are you not the ones "},{"t":"eating","s":["H0398"],"a":[6]},{"t":" and are you not the ones "},{"t":"drinking","s":["H8354"],"a":[8]},{"t":"?"}]},{"n":7,"text":"Are not these the words which Jehovah proclaimed by the former prophets when Jerusalem was inhabited and prosperous and had cities round about her, when the Negev and the lowlands were inhabited?","tok":[{"t":"Are not these the "},{"t":"words","s":["H1697"],"a":[2]},{"t":" which "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"proclaimed","s":["H7121"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"by","s":["H3027"],"a":[6]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"former","s":["H7223"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"prophets","s":["H5030"],"a":[7]},{"t":" when "},{"t":"Jerusalem","s":["H3389"],"a":[10]},{"t":" was "},{"t":"inhabited","s":["H3427"],"a":[11]},{"t":" and prosperous and had "},{"t":"cities","s":["H5892"],"a":[13]},{"t":" round about "},{"t":"her","s":["H5439"],"a":[14]},{"t":", when the Negev and the lowlands were "},{"t":"inhabited","s":["H3427"],"a":[17]},{"t":"?"}]},{"n":8,"text":"And the word of Jehovah came to Zechariah, saying,","tok":[{"t":"And the "},{"t":"word","s":["H1697"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":" came to "},{"t":"Zechariah","s":["H2148"],"a":[4]},{"t":", "},{"t":"saying","s":["H0559"],"a":[5]},{"t":","}]},{"n":9,"text":"Thus speaks Jehovah of hosts, saying, Judge with judgment of truth, and show lovingkindness and compassion each to his brother;","tok":[{"t":"Thus "},{"t":"speaks","s":["H0559"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[3]},{"t":", "},{"t":"saying","s":["H0559"],"a":[4]},{"t":", Judge with "},{"t":"judgment","s":["H4941"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of truth, and show lovingkindness and "},{"t":"compassion","s":["H7356"],"a":[9]},{"t":" each to his "},{"t":"brother","s":["H0251"],"a":[13]},{"t":";"}]},{"n":10,"text":"And do not oppress the widow and the orphan, the stranger and the poor; and let none of you think evil in your hearts about his brother.","tok":[{"t":"And do not "},{"t":"oppress","s":["H6231"],"a":[5]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"widow","s":["H0490"],"a":[0]},{"t":" and the "},{"t":"orphan","s":["H3490"],"a":[1]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"stranger","s":["H1616"],"a":[2]},{"t":" and the "},{"t":"poor","s":["H6041"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; and let none of you think "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7451"],"a":[6]},{"t":" in your "},{"t":"hearts","s":["H3824"],"a":[11]},{"t":" about his "},{"t":"brother","s":["H0251"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":11,"text":"But they refused to listen, and they turned a stubborn shoulder and closed their ears from hearing;","tok":[{"t":"But they "},{"t":"refused","s":["H3985"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"listen","s":["H7181"],"a":[1]},{"t":", and they turned a stubborn "},{"t":"shoulder","s":["H3802"],"a":[3]},{"t":" and closed their "},{"t":"ears","s":["H0241"],"a":[5]},{"t":" from "},{"t":"hearing","s":["H8085"],"a":[7]},{"t":";"}]},{"n":12,"text":"And they set their hearts like adamant so as not to hear the instruction and the words which Jehovah of hosts sent by His Spirit through the former prophets; therefore great wrath came from Jehovah of hosts.","tok":[{"t":"And they set their "},{"t":"hearts","s":["H3820"],"a":[0]},{"t":" like adamant so as not to "},{"t":"hear","s":["H8085"],"a":[3]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"instruction","s":["H8451"],"a":[5]},{"t":" and the "},{"t":"words","s":["H1697"],"a":[7]},{"t":" which "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[10]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"sent","s":["H7971"],"a":[9]},{"t":" "},{"t":"by","s":["H3027"],"a":[13]},{"t":" His "},{"t":"Spirit","s":["H7307"],"a":[12]},{"t":" through the "},{"t":"former","s":["H7223"],"a":[15]},{"t":" "},{"t":"prophets","s":["H5030"],"a":[14]},{"t":"; therefore "},{"t":"great","s":["H1419"],"a":[18]},{"t":" "},{"t":"wrath","s":["H7110"],"a":[17]},{"t":" came from "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[20]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[21]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":13,"text":"And as He called and they would not hear, so they called and I would not hear, says Jehovah of hosts;","tok":[{"t":"And as He called and they would not "},{"t":"hear","s":["H8085"],"a":[4]},{"t":", so they called and I would not "},{"t":"hear","s":["H8085"],"a":[8]},{"t":", "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[9]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[10]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[11]},{"t":";"}]},{"n":14,"text":"But with a storm I scattered them away upon all the nations, whom they did not know. Thus the land is desolate behind them, so that no one passes through it and no one returns to it; for they have made the desirable land desolate.","tok":[{"t":"But with a storm I scattered them away upon all the "},{"t":"nations","s":["H1471"],"a":[3]},{"t":", whom they did not know. Thus the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[7]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"desolate","s":["H8074"],"a":[8]},{"t":" behind them, so that no one passes "},{"t":"through","s":["H5674"],"a":[10]},{"t":" it and no one "},{"t":"returns","s":["H7725"],"a":[11]},{"t":" to it; for they have made the desirable "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[13]},{"t":" "},{"t":"desolate","s":["H8047"],"a":[15]},{"t":"."}]}]}
